@HostAddress = https://localhost:7001

### Create an order with two items (15% discount)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 1,
  "discountType": "Percentage",
  "discountValue": 15,
  "items": [
    { "productName": "Laptop", "quantity": 1, "unitPrice": 1200 },
    { "productName": "Mouse", "quantity": 2, "unitPrice": 25.50 }
  ]
}

### Create an invalid order (returns every broken rule)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 1,
  "discountType": "Percentage",
  "discountValue": 150,
  "items": [
    { "productName": "", "quantity": 0, "unitPrice": -1 },
    { "productName": "Keyboard", "quantity": 1, "unitPrice": 40 },
    { "productName": "keyboard", "quantity": 1, "unitPrice": 40 }
  ]
}

### List orders (filter by product and customer, sort by total, page)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/orders?search=lap&customerId=1&sortBy=Total&sortDescending=true&page=1&pageSize=10

### Get an order
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/orders/1

### Update an order (replaces its items and recalculates totals; the customer can't change)
PUT {{HostAddress}}/api/orders/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "discountType": "FixedAmount",
  "discountValue": 30,
  "items": [
    { "productName": "Monitor", "quantity": 2, "unitPrice": 300 },
    { "productName": "HDMI Cable", "quantity": 3, "unitPrice": 10 }
  ]
}

### Delete an order (soft delete)
DELETE {{HostAddress}}/api/orders/1

### Preview a discount
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/orders/discount-preview?discountType=Percentage&discountValue=15&subTotal=200

### List customers
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/customers
